WEBVTT

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:09.110
To think we'd be trounced so thoroughly...

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.820
But that's Ike, I suppose.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:19.490
Isaac's like a child--he just wants
to strut around with his new toy.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:24.080
Has everyone evacuated?

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:27.580
It's underway. Have patience.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.640
Yo, Elliot... Karen...

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.100
It's been a while, Ike.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.690
You've sure made a violent entrance
for visiting an old friend.

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:54.030
I don't want much--

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:58.870
just to bring you
and Karen back to DEM.

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:02.040
If I refuse?

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:06.420
Well then, you'll just
have to play with me.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:08.080
Beelzebub.

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:16.090
So be it. You've never been
one to listen to others.

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:19.550
Please, Elliot.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:21.560
It's all right, Karen.

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:28.400
Now that I think of it,
this is the first time we've faced off.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:35.610
Yeah. I'm shaking in my boots
at the very thought of it, Elliot.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.840
Mukuro...

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.510
So that's Mukuro?

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:31.230
Michael.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:33.650
Lataib.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.870
Deploy Protect Territory!

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.500
Hmm?

00:03:55.500 --> 00:04:01.220
Now you can reach her without a spacesuit.
Shido, it's do or die.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.590
Got it. Send me to her.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.850
It's the enemy. Four DEM ships.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:15.020
Goetia... She got us good
before history was changed, but...

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:18.400
I'm glad to get a shot at revenge.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:22.030
Deploy Dual Territory:
Spatial Control and Defense!

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:22.950
--Sir!
--Sir!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:26.200
Time to teleport.
Mukuro's all yours, Shido.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:29.080
Leave it to me! Stay safe, guys!

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:41.590
You're Shido, correct? I told you:
Muku doesn't want to be saved.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.880
I didn't come to talk with you.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:49.220
I'm here for the real Mukuro
whose heart isn't locked.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:53.270
It was Muku who locked Muku's own heart.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:56.440
Mind your own business.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:05:01.360
But why would you lock your own heart?
What happened that--?

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:04.900
You're free to disregard my warning

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:09.200
just as Muku is free
to deal with you as I see fit.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.460
I won't let my big brother get hurt!

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:19.750
Kotori!

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:25.050
Yup. We're using Territory to detect
and dodge incoming objects.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:30.430
But don't over-rely on it.
You won't last getting hit by an Angel.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:33.810
Got it! Thanks, Kotori! MARIA!

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:36.270
Haniel!

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:42.730
Hmm. I see...
An Angel you stole from a Spirit?

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:47.910
It's mean to say I stole it.
I'm borrowing it to save you!

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.530
Kaleidoscope!

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.750
What...?

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:58.250
Mukuro, I'm gonna open
your heart with this!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.300
Commander, Bandersnatch.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:06.010
That's not all! This response...!

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.430
Artemisia Ashcroft.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:11.510
Kotori!

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.430
We'll fight, too.

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.140
I'll help, too!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:19.520
We'll make the wind blow,
even here in the airless sky!

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:23.650
Agreement. We won't sit around
and do nothing.

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:30.410
So be it. I was hoping to keep
you guys out of the fight, but...

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:34.870
MARIA, it's time for <i>that</i>.
Origami can handle it.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.040
Roger.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.620
An emergency arming device...

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:48.010
AW-111, Brunhild. It's our latest model.
Put it to good use.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:01.060
Territory hit! No damage!

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:05.230
Not even a greeting first?
Now that's a low blow.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:08.280
Receiving transmission.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:11.280
We meet again, Kotori Itsuka.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:16.950
What do you want, Ellen Mathers?
For us to surrender?

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:22.460
That's right. I see you have a new ship,
but it's useless.

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:25.000
I'll just wreck it <i>again</i>.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:28.260
I see. They must know, too:

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:33.590
that in the other world,
Fraxinus was destroyed by Goetia.

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:41.560
Beelzebub's power is impressive.
Your boss must be in good spirits.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:46.730
Good spirits, you say?
That's not far from the truth.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:52.610
I know. Otherwise, he wouldn't be
invading enemy bases himself.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:57.490
Huh? What did you say?
Ike attacked Ratatoskr?

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.620
What, you didn't know?

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:04.790
Oh? I thought you were close,
but I guess he doesn't trust you.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:11.920
If you think I'm lying, go check yourself.
Or are you scared to know?

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:15.180
Trying to rile me up won't work.

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:20.810
I'll simply check after the battle
is over. It won't take five minutes.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:27.230
Enemy moving to surround.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:32.610
Change of plans: only Tohka and Origami
go out. Everyone else, standby.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.740
Aww! Why?!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.700
Opinion. We can help, too.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:41.700
I've got a plan.
For now, just do as I say.

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:46.130
Bring it on, my dear rival.

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:50.090
I'll show you the power
of the new Fraxinus.

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:53.630
Now then, shall we begin our date?

00:08:58.010 --> 00:08:59.470
Lataib.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.890
Zadkiel!

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:07.940
How strange. Are you truly human?

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.730
That's what I tell myself, at least!

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:17.240
Artemisia Ashcroft!

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:21.330
Sorry, but I'll be taking that Spirit!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:33.300
--You okay, Shido?
--Origami!

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:38.510
Shido!

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:46.140
You okay, Shido?

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:48.560
Yeah! Thanks, Tohka!

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.150
Zadkiel!

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:57.200
Sandalphon!

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.950
--Fall back, Tohka!
--Are you sure?

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:07.710
I'm fine. Kotori, can you do me a favor?

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:15.590
Artemisia, why are you with DEM?

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:19.840
It doesn't make sense for you
to be friendly with them.

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:25.220
How do you know my name?

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:34.860
It doesn't matter. With you around,
it seems I can't finish my mission.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:37.650
Sorry, but I'll have to destroy you!

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:46.620
You're strong. Way stronger than me...
as a Wizard.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.250
That's...?

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:58.170
I see... You were there
when I came for Sister.

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:04.850
Good. If you're a Spirit,
I can kill you without guilt.

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:17.940
Deploy Yggdrafolium one through ten!

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.670
Converging magic power cannon,
Mistilteinn! Fire!

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:59.820
It's one of Fraxinus' new powers.
Modeled off Goetia, unfortunately.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:04.200
Your power and maneuverability
have certainly increased.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:08.990
However, those who challenge Heaven
will have their wings plucked.

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.540
Be scorched by the flames of God.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:34.940
Who said we only had one trump card?

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:39.440
Thanks, guys. My Spirit power
alone wouldn't cut it.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:42.950
Of course. I'm glad to help.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:46.120
When we come together, we're unbeatable!

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:50.450
It's like all our Spirit powers
are mixing together!

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:54.420
Something about that
makes me really happy!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:56.130
System Blōt:

00:12:56.130 --> 00:13:03.050
a new weapon driven by Spirit power
which surpasses the limits of Territory.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:08.680
This time, victory is ours!
Bite the dust, World's Strongest Wizard!

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:21.610
Only the small fry are left!
Let's clean 'em up!

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:31.540
You're still here?
You really don't learn, Shido.

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:36.870
I told you:
I came to unlock to your heart!

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.040
Michael!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.340
--Let's go, Tohka!
--Mm!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:54.060
Mm. I knew you'd try that.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:58.150
Nice try, but it's over now.

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:01.900
Now, Shido!

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:07.990
You're kidding...
Who are you?

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:11.910
A neighborhood high schooler. Lataib!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.000
Metatron!

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:26.670
Not bad--combining Spirit power
and generative magic.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:29.970
Goetia!

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:34.310
You've lost. Give it up.

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:44.110
I'm afraid you're wrong.
Our goal... is to take out the Spirits!

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:47.490
Shido!

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:51.490
Mukuro!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.160
Zadkiel!

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:56.120
--Shido!
--Shido!

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:08.420
It's all right, Mukuro!
I'll protect you!

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:30.860
Nice to meet you. I'm going to be
your new mother. And this is Dad.

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.120
Nice to meet you.

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:36.950
I'll be your sister, so let's get along.

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:55.390
--Shido!
--Shido!

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:57.350
--Boy!
--Darling!

00:15:57.350 --> 00:16:00.310
What's wrong, Shido? You're crying?

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:05.520
Uh, it's just from a dream I had.
Where is this?

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:11.400
Fraxinus' infirmary. It wasn't easy
catching you out of the sky.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:15.780
Oh, yeah... And Mukuro?!
What about Mukuro?!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:20.500
We don't know. During the fall,
you got separated.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.160
For real?! Then--!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.380
Muku is right here.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.040
--Mukuro?!
--Mukuro?!

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:30.050
What a mean guy, making Muku wait.

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:34.260
But it's fine. I'm in a good mood now.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.930
Eh? Uh, huh?

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:38.850
Such a sourpuss.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:43.600
Is this because your heart opened up?

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:47.650
Convinced. And her emotions have returned.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:54.070
E-Even if that's true...
Mukuro, you're so different now.

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:58.660
Is it odd for Muku's heart to be touched

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:02.660
by the one who worked hard to open it?

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:06.130
The moment it was unlocked,

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:11.590
I felt grateful for
everything you've done.

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:16.180
Though, the reason I'm fond of you is...

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.720
Let's see...

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.850
Just because?

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:22.430
Hey, hey...

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:29.360
Yes, just because. I feel like
you and Muku are close.

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:30.570
Close?

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:35.740
Anyway, since it seems
you haven't recovered yet,

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:39.200
I shall return tomorrow.

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:42.410
I'll see you tomorrow, Mister.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:48.290
Didn't see that coming! That was Mukuchin?

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:51.920
Her personality's nothing like I heard!

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:56.970
Surprise. I had imagined
a very rude Spirit.

00:17:56.970 --> 00:18:03.720
But what a cutie. Her body is tiny,
but she's big where it counts.

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:07.770
Darling is such a perv!

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:13.280
She said she'll come tomorrow.
What then, Shido?

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.900
Uh, well...

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:21.490
Enough, enough! We'll discuss that later.
Shido's still healing up.

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:27.670
The ship has some new facilities.
Why don't you go soothe your body?

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:29.580
"New facilities"?

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.130
"Bath"
"Fraxinus"

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:42.600
A bath imbued with magic, huh?
It's true--I do feel great!

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:50.150
But what was that dream all about?
That little girl was...

00:18:56.400 --> 00:19:01.820
Washing yourself while injured
won't be easy. I'll help, Shido.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:04.200
Whoa, whoa! I'll be fine!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:09.210
Leave it to me.
I'll lick--wash you clean.

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:11.080
You just said, "lick"!

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:18.010
Darling! I came to wash your back!

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:21.550
Shido, feeling better?! I'm here to help!

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:24.970
Liking the healing bath?!

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:30.940
Reminisce. When it comes to bathing
together, you want the Yamai Sisters.

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:36.650
Guys! Shido came here to heal,
so let's not forget that!

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:40.490
Clearly, all of us didn't need to come.

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:45.330
But bathing with everyone will be fun!

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:50.540
I know! How about you and Yoshino
wash each other's backs?

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:53.040
Y-You wouldn't mind?

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:57.710
Whew! All these cuties
make for such a nice view!

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:05.140
Ike!

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:08.600
We may have shook hands a bit too hard.

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:13.730
I guess Elliot was incredibly
glad to see me.

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:19.490
Then, it's true?
You attacked Ratatoskr's base?

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:24.820
Yeah. But unfortunately,
I let Elliot slip away.

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:27.120
And your little sister, too.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:33.370
Still, with Realizers,
I'll be on my feet tomorrow.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.710
You didn't fare so well, either.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:43.340
Due to my shortcomings. I deserve
whatever punishment comes my way.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:47.390
But, Ike, you owe me an explanation.

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:50.390
Why didn't you tell me about Elliot?

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:56.310
If I had brought you, wouldn't you have
killed Elliot without question?

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:05.070
Ready, Shido?

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:11.500
Yeah, but where am I meeting Mukuro?
Am I going back to space?

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:17.790
That's the big question. She said
she'd come back, so we think she will...

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.960
It's time, Mister.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:25.260
Shido!

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:37.520
Huh?

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:42.110
We're here on the surface,
just like you wanted!

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:47.240
You said there're lots of
fun things to do here!

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:50.490
So, let's get going, Mister!

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:54.960
"Episode 06:
'An Opened Heart.'"

00:23:26.260 --> 00:23:28.970
Shido has opened Mukuro's heart.

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:33.890
As a new battle begins,
a new Origami and Tohka awake.

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:36.890
Next time: "Locked Memories."

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:39.940
"Episode 07: 'Locked Memories.'"

00:23:36.890 --> 00:23:39.640
Be tasty! Moé Moé Kyun!
